  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  timelineDirector: {fileID: 1931712292}
  typewriter: {fileID: 1931712294}
  audioSource: {fileID: 0}
  line1Audio: {fileID: 0}
  line2Audio: {fileID: 0}
  line3Audio: {fileID: 0}
  line4Audio: {fileID: 0}
  line5Audio: {fileID: 0}
  line6Audio: {fileID: 0}
  line1Text: Another sleepless night. Another dead end on the 409 job.
  line2Text: Someone cracked First National. Clean. No alarms. No cameras. No sensors
    triggered. Nothing.
  line3Text: They're calling him The Ghost. Fitting... because there's nothing here.
    It's like he was never there at all.
  line4Text: But ghosts don't exist. Somebody did this. And they made a mistake somewhere.
    They always do.
  line5Text: No prints. No footage. No mistakes. 409 like it never happened.
  line6Text: To find him... I have to think like him. Move like him. Be him.
